{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"gitfiles","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Git files","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Git files (.gitignore .gitattributes .gitmodules .dockerignore).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"gitfiles","name":"Git files","extensions":[".gitignore",".gitattributes",".gitmodules",".dockerignore",".npmignore",".eslintignore"],"grammar":"grammars/gitfiles.json","filenames":[".gitignore",".gitattributes",".gitmodules",".dockerignore",".npmignore",".gitkeep","CODEOWNERS"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Git files","path":"snippets/gitfiles.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/gitfiles.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*!\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\*\\\\*?|\\\\?\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*\\\\[[^\\\\]]+\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+(?=\\\\s*=)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/$\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/gitfiles.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Node ignore\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"node\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"node_modules/\",\n      \"dist/\",\n      \".env\",\n      \"*.log\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Common Node ignores\"\n  },\n  \"Rust ignore\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rust\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"target/\",\n      \"Cargo.lock\",\n      \"**/*.rs.bk\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Common Rust ignores\"\n  },\n  \"Python ignore\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"py\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"__pycache__/\",\n      \"*.pyc\",\n      \".venv/\",\n      \".env\",\n      \"dist/\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Common Python ignores\"\n  },\n  \"Laravel ignore\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"laravel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"/vendor\",\n      \"/node_modules\",\n      \".env\",\n      \"/storage/*.key\",\n      \"/public/storage\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Common Laravel ignores\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Git files\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Git files.\n\n## Files\n\n`.gitignore`, `.gitattributes`, `.gitmodules`, `.dockerignore`, `.npmignore`, `.eslintignore`, `.gitignore`, `.gitattributes`, `.gitmodules`, `.dockerignore`, `.npmignore`, `.gitkeep`, `CODEOWNERS`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node` | Common Node ignores |\n| `rust` | Common Rust ignores |\n| `py` | Common Python ignores |\n| `laravel` | Common Laravel ignores |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}